  "reflectionText": "The writer named the names of the elders one by one: Abel, Enoch, Noah, Abraham, Sarah, Isaac, Jacob, Joseph. They all died in faith, not having received the promises. What is it to be added to the list of names of those who walked toward a city they would never reach in their own lifetime?"
